---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Acquisition policy | The Catch" current="Methodology" noindex>
<div slot="locator" class="locator"><span>METHODOLOGY</span><span>ACQUISITION POLICY</span><span class="loc-status-red">PREVIEW · NOT PUBLISHED</span></div>
<div class="content"><main class="method-main acquisition-main"><p class="acquisition-eyebrow">How the record begins</p><h1>Acquisition policy</h1><p class="lede">The Catch names the source families and venues that enter the record, the cadence observed for each live adapter, and the boundaries that remain visible when a source is not captured.</p><div class="acquisition-notice"><strong>Candidate policy pending activation</strong><br>These proposed values are not live behavior. This page is not public and does not promote claims.</div><p class="acquisition-observed">Policy observed July 18, 2026, 00:00 UTC · candidate values pending activation</p><section><h2>Source families and cadence</h2><table class="acquisition-table"><thead><tr><th>Family</th><th>Venue</th><th>What enters</th><th>Observed cadence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Federal Register</th><td>federalregister.gov</td><td>Federal Register notices in the active source profile</td><td class="acquisition-cadence">daily intake · warm change watch, weekly</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">CHAMP minutes</th><td>Fulton County Schools CHAMP archive</td><td>Rendered board and committee meeting records</td><td class="acquisition-cadence">weekly intake · cold change watch, monthly</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">AP reporting</th><td>AP hub</td><td>Wire-service trade reporting available to the active adapter</td><td class="acquisition-cadence">hourly intake · hot change watch, daily</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Federal Reserve FOMC</th><td>federalreserve.gov</td><td>FOMC statements, decisions, and meeting materials</td><td class="acquisition-cadence">scheduled event intake · warm change watch, weekly</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="acquisition-note">The intake and change-watch values above come from the candidate scan policy. They are not presented as active service behavior.</p></section><section><h2>Known exclusions</h2><p>Coverage is shown as a ledger of what was not ingested, not as an implied completeness claim.</p><article class="acquisition-ledger-entry"><div class="acquisition-ledger-head"><b>Simbli Fulton official-print minutes endpoint</b><span>Coverage boundary</span></div><p>Official-print records not captured · 9 records</p></article></section><section><h2>Human intervention ledger</h2><p class="acquisition-empty">No interventions recorded.</p></section></main></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style is:global>
.acquisition-main{max-width:58rem}.acquisition-eyebrow{color:var(--red);font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.68rem}.acquisition-main h1{font-family:var(--serif);margin:.4rem 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.1}.acquisition-notice{border-left:4px solid var(--red);background:#fff2f1;max-width:44rem;margin:1.5rem 0 1rem;padding:.9rem 1rem}.acquisition-notice strong{color:var(--red)}.acquisition-observed,.acquisition-note{color:var(--slate);font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:.68rem}.acquisition-table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.86rem}.acquisition-table th,.acquisition-table td{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:.75rem .55rem}.acquisition-table thead th{color:var(--slate);font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.64rem}.acquisition-cadence{color:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap}.acquisition-typed{color:var(--slate);font-style:italic}.acquisition-ledger-entry{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);max-width:48rem;padding:1rem 0}.acquisition-ledger-head{justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;display:flex}.acquisition-ledger-head span{color:var(--red);font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:.68rem}.acquisition-empty{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--slate);padding:1rem 0}@media (width<=760px){.acquisition-table{font-size:.8rem}.acquisition-table th,.acquisition-table td{padding:.6rem .35rem}}

</style>
